<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Henderson, William (1879), <a href="https://archive.org/details/cu31924006726552/page/n289" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><em>Notes on the folk-lore of the northern counties of England and the borders</em></a>, London: Pub. for the Folk-lore Society by W. Satchell, Peyton and co.</p>



